  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  WeiblAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "WeiblAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → shv λv Xv « shv 0 + λv 0 + Xv 0 + → sh λ X « 'IFTE(X<0;0;1-EXP(-((X/λ)^sh)))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<0;0;(sh/λ)*((X/λ)^(sh-1))*EXP(-((X/λ)^sh)))' →Num "PDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<0;1;EXP(-((X/λ)^sh)))' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'λ*Γ(1+1/sh)' →Num "μ" →Tag 'λ*√(Γ(1+2/sh)-Γ(1+1/sh)^2)' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE shv λv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
